    "startS": 907.1,
    "endS": 923.6,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "and I think that that is very important because we, you know, in society, we're like, so becoming more and more disconnected to, like human interaction in especially, like, touch or anything along those lines.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
