    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 1151.6,
    "endS": 1168.7,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "Like, often with, like, a handmade mug. Even a slipcase mug. People are like, well, why is it 50 bucks? I can buy ten mugs with that. And I'm like, but you need ten more mugs because like, do you have ten people in your family?",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T06:07:21.113Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "5d937fd1-d392-4e2f-83ba-92abc9f1fa9f",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 1172.1,
    "endS": 1197.2,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "one of my bigger spiel or whatever is that we need to really think about stuff like take a pause and think about the value of items, not just, um, how much you can get with your money, but what is the true value of having one mug that you really like versus having ten mugs that you find disposable? Chances are those ten mugs are going to end up in donation.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T06:07:21.113Z"
  },
